    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis well-proportioned family home, set on a substantial landscaped site, is located in a peaceful countryside setting, yet less than 10 minutes' drive from Westport town centre.\n\nWith a total floor area of approximately 195sqm/2,100sqft, ground floor accommodation comprises of entrance hall, large living room with a double height ceiling and solid fuel stove, kitchen/dining room, sun room which opens out onto the paved patio area, utility room, three bedrooms (one en-suite with a walk in wardrobe, bathroom and a hotpress. \n\nThe first floor offers a spacious landing which could easily be utilised as a second living room or an office, two double bedrooms (one with walk in wardrobe) and a shower room. The property is presented in good condition throughout. \n\nThe property sits on a site measuring approximately 0.7 acres with well maintained gardens and a feature paved sun terrace enclosed by a wooden fence with built in planter boxes and lawns to the front and rear, which benefit from lovely countryside views. \nThere is a steeltech shed to the side (6.7m x 3.04m (22ft x 10ft), which is ideal for storge.\n\nArdygommon is a conveniently situated residential area with Knockrooskey National School a 2km drive and a Westport Country Lodge hotel/restaurant only 1.3km away. \n\nAughagower Villiage is located within 5 minutes and offers a pre-school, church, shop, post office and community playground. Westport's many amenities are within easy reach with secondary schools, sports clubs and leisure facilities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall (Inc. Staircase) - 5.45m x 1.27m & 2.56m x 2.34m & 3.08m x 1.05m\nTiled and semi-solid oak floor, solid pine carpeted staircase.\n\nLiving Room - 4.94m x 4.02m\nPine floor, solid fuel stove, double height tongue & groove ceiling, curtains\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.81m x 4.28m\nTiled floor and backsplash, painted solid oak kitchen, formica worktop, integrated fridge/freezer, dishwasher, blinds\n\nUtility Room - 2.55m x 1.59m\nTiled floor, oak units, formica work top, plumbed washer/dryer, door to back yard\n\nSun Room - 4.99m x 3.58m\nPine Floor, double doors to patio area\n\nHotpress - 1.4m x 1.1m\nFully shelved\n\nBedroom One - 3.72m x 3.7m\nLaminate beech floor, curtains/blinds\n\nWalk-In-Wardrobe - 1.3m x 1.2m\nLaminate floor, fully shelved\n\nEn-Suite - 2.18m x 1.92m\nFully tiled, electric shower, wall storage unit, whb unit, wc\n\nBedroom Two - 3.69m x 3.24m\nLaminate floor, curtains\n\nBedroom Three/Office - 3.68m x 3.3m\nLaminate floor\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 4.66m x 3.53m\nSolid pine floor, pine tongue and groove ceiling, velux\n\nBedroom Four - 4.11m x 3.44m\nLaminate floor, gable & velux window, curtain\n\nWalk-in-Wardrobe - 4.09m x 1.33m\nFully shelved\n\nBedroom Five - 4.77m x 3.16m\nLaminate floor, velux window\n\nShower Room - 2.91m x 2.174m\nDouble entrance off bedroom and hallway, tiled floor and backsplash, wc, whb\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Conveniently located five bedroom detached residence</li><li>Set on a site of approximately 0.29ha/0.7acres</li><li>OFCH and Solid Fuel Stove</li><li>Convenient location for Knockrooskey NS & Aughagower Pre-School</li><li>A short drive from Westport town and all its amenities</ul>"
